<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<model xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/3dmanufacturing/core/2015/02" xmlns:p="http://schemas.microsoft.com/3dmanufacturing/production/2015/06" unit="millimeter" xml:lang="en-US" requiredextensions="p" xmlns:BambuStudio="http://schemas.bambulab.com/package/2021">
 <metadata name="Application">BambuStudio-02.03.00.70</metadata>
 <metadata name="BambuStudio:3mfVersion">1</metadata>
 <metadata name="Copyright" />
 <metadata name="CreationDate">2025-10-30</metadata>
 <metadata name="Description">&amp;lt;boostme&amp;gt;&amp;lt;boosttitle&amp;gt;Boost Me&amp;lt;/boosttitle&amp;gt;&amp;lt;boostcontent&amp;gt;Please support with a Boost next opportunity you have! If not, please Like, Bookmark, Download and Share any of my designs that catch your eye! Thank you!&amp;lt;/boostcontent&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/boostme&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;This optionally &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;customizable&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; ticket / voucher is a perfect gift for loved ones, friends, or customers alike! A heart-warming gift that can represent a promise of your undivided attention dedicated to your loved on upon request and the presentation of the ticket, and the contract you bound yourself to when you gifted it. Stop, drop everything, and &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;CUDDLE TIME&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;There is a perforated version and a &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;non&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;-perforated version in the Print Profiles depending on your uses!&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;You can gift a voucher to make a 3D print for the receiver, whatever they might want!&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;It can be a reminder to let things go and forget the argument on a free pass, or anything your imagination can come up with!&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;The coupon can be &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;naughty&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; or &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;nice;&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; whatever your flavor of the week is.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;A fantastic stocking stuffer for the family. &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;CHORE FREE DAY&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; is sure to be a coveted favorite for the kids, and can even become awarded upon exemplary behavior or accomplishment, teaching them to work hard so they can play hard!&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;The possibilities are infinite!&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;The 3mf is preloaded with a plate of:&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;-(1) &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;u&amp;gt;FREE PASS&amp;lt;/u&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;-(1) &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;u&amp;gt;CHORE FREE DAY&amp;lt;/u&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;-(1) &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;u&amp;gt;I.O.U&amp;lt;/u&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;  [I Owe You]&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;-(1) &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;u&amp;gt;1x WIN ARGUMENT&amp;lt;/u&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;-(1) &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;u&amp;gt;CUDDLE TIME&amp;lt;/u&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;Some other ideas &amp;lt;i&amp;gt;not included&amp;lt;/i&amp;gt; that you could customize for your use could include:&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;- 1x FREE MASSAGE&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;- 1x PARK IN DRIVEWAY&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;- I PICK THE MOVIE&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;- ANY DINNER I WANT&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;- DAY OF COMPLIMENTS&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;- PICNIC DAY&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;- GAME NIGHT&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;- MAKE DINNER&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;- FOOT RUB&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;- DATE NIGHT&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;- BREAKFAST IN BED&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;u&amp;gt;Suggestions for Ratings and Reviews:&amp;lt;/u&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;Please take a moment to write why you are rating the value you choose, especially if less than 5 stars. This not only helps any creator improve a design to further benefit your future use, but also helps fellow consumers make their own determinations and modifications where necessary. A mere standalone rating of less than 5-star helps no one, as no one is aware as to why you are displeased and where the shortcoming is. It may even help you better understand your printer and how to utilize it as an issue may often lie with the preparations you have made or failed to make.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;u&amp;gt;Directions for Customizing/Editing:&amp;lt;/u&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;u&amp;gt;Step 1.0&amp;lt;/u&amp;gt;: Open Bambu Studio.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;u&amp;gt;Step 2.0&amp;lt;/u&amp;gt;: Click on “Objects.”&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;u&amp;gt;Step2.1&amp;lt;/u&amp;gt;: Select the desired body of text that you want to change from the list of Objects.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;img src=&amp;#34;https://makerworld.bblmw.com/makerworld/model/DSM00000001942792/design/2025-12-19_70bd3f697128d.png&amp;#34;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;u&amp;gt;Step 3.0&amp;lt;/u&amp;gt;: Select the Text Tool from the slicer toolbar to open the menu where you can make your desired changes.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;u&amp;gt;Step 3.1&amp;lt;/u&amp;gt;: Change anything you want! Primarily the ‘Input Text’ and ‘Font’ are what most people will want to change so I simply highlighted those two parameters, but you are of course able to change whatever parameters you want on Bambu Studio or your favorite slicer.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;img src=&amp;#34;https://makerworld.bblmw.com/makerworld/model/DSM00000001942792/design/2025-12-19_f6be3727d2428.png&amp;#34;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;</metadata>
